{"4592100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umigami Eye", "steam_appid": 4592100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a psychological horror game and walking simulator. Close your eyes to influence your environment. Monsters jumping towards at your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a short horror game of 20-30 minutes in length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a house you don’t recognize. Every time you step outside, you find yourself in a different place — a garden, a different room, a memory. You can’t remember what you did yesterday. You can’t remember why you’re here. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes to influence your surroundings. Close them to reveal hidden paths and distort reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You leave the house and appear in a new, unpredictable location each time. Close your eyes to influence your environment and leave the house. The more you explore, the more pieces of the truth you uncover — and creatures may strike when you least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a loop of forgetting. Every day begins the same: you wake up in the house, unsure of what happened before. Your goal is to uncover what you’ve been doing here — and why your mind refuses to hold onto it. As memories resurface, the house reveals its real purpose… and your role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592100/extras/3a35f91cd419e4f4d3ae76c7834fd636.poster.avif?t=1778241500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592100/extras/3a35f91cd419e4f4d3ae76c7834fd636.webm?t=1778241500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592100/extras/3a35f91cd419e4f4d3ae76c7834fd636.mp4?t=1778241500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a psychological horror game and walking simulator. Close your eyes to influence your environment. Monsters jumping towards at your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a short horror game of 20-30 minutes in length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a house you don’t recognize. Every time you step outside, you find yourself in a different place — a garden, a different room, a memory. You can’t remember what you did yesterday. You can’t remember why you’re here. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close your eyes to influence your surroundings. Close them to reveal hidden paths and distort reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You leave the house and appear in a new, unpredictable location each time. Close your eyes to influence your environment and leave the house. The more you explore, the more pieces of the truth you uncover — and creatures may strike when you least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a loop of forgetting. Every day begins the same: you wake up in the house, unsure of what happened before. Your goal is to uncover what you’ve been doing here — and why your mind refuses to hold onto it. As memories resurface, the house reveals its real purpose… and your role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets